  "abi": "i64_array_bytes_output",
  "description": "Return one derivative-weight column from Fornberg's arbitrary-node recurrence over F_998244353.",
  "source": {
    "title": "Bengt Fornberg, Generation of Finite Difference Formulas on Arbitrarily Spaced Grids (1988), section 2",
